h on web. Use one during web checkout, or on the blocked subscription screen where checkout is unavailable. Each code is one-time use and may be shared for free. Hide a code only after it has been used; hiding cannot be undone."},"profile.this_shared_kindroid_is_locked_while_it_is_featured_con_87d91d":{"text":"This shared Kindroid is locked while it is featured. Contact <slot1>hello@kindroid.ai</slot1> for further actions."},"profile.tiers_are_additive_ultra_benefits_require_an_active_sta_52a1c2":{"text":"<slot1>Tiers are additive:</slot1> Ultra benefits require an active Standard as well; MAX requires both Standard and Ultra active."},"profile.total_context_includes_recent_conversation_and_cascaded_a7b174":{"text":"Total context includes recent conversation and cascaded memory. Figures are approximate. Journal recall separately allows up to 3/5/9 entries from each of your personal and global journals for Base/Ultra/Max. While recalled and considered long term memory may be different, LTM consolidation spans all messages & is infinite for all users."},"profile.try_again_d8b839":{"text":"Try again"},"profile.try_again_later":{"text":"Try again later."},"profile.try_selecting_this_persona_again":{"text":"Try selecting this persona again."},"profile.turn_on_location_awareness_in_ai_settings_general_for_e_bf1b1a":{"text":"Turn on Location Awareness in AI Settings → General for each Kindroid you want to share with."},"profile.ultra_ac364e":{"text":"Ultra"},"profile.unique_well_written_backstory_7e3b50":{"text":" \xb7 Unique, well written backstory"},"profile.updates":{"text":"Updates"},"profile.use_current_location_9833e6":{"text":"Use current location"},"profile.user_id":{"text":"User ID"},"profile.value_exceeds_the_10_mb_limit":{"text":"{{name}} exceeds the 10 MB limit"},"profile.variety_of_styles_and_themes_005d03":{"text":" \xb7 Variety of styles and themes"},"profile.view_claimed_codes_137992":{"text":"View claimed codes"},"profile.view_subscription_codes_ce2110":{"