 notes about important facts, growth, and ongoing threads. The switch saves immediately."},"chat.feedback_43f35970a1ef":{"text":"Let this Kindroid form long-term memories and update what it has learned from your conversations over time."},"chat.feedback_454a78052b10":{"text":"Allow this kin to use your latest foreground location and saved-place matches. Kindroid only reads your location while you\'re using the app — never in the background. Manage geolocation globally in Preferences → Geolocation."},"chat.feedback_4b47b845c063":{"text":"Uses Call image"},"chat.feedback_51c6134f2c73":{"text":"Location, attire, activity, time, etc."},"chat.feedback_58a6d07a84f9":{"text":"No recalled memories yet."},"chat.feedback_60009ab4794b":{"text":"Long Term Memories"},"chat.feedback_6408d1218e17":{"text":"Base image shown during calls. Live Avatar replaces it when active."},"chat.feedback_72594773f804":{"text":"The synthesis engine used for this kin\'s voice. V4 and V4 Fast cost 1.75x as many audio credits as V2; V3 and V3 Fast cost 1.5x."},"chat.feedback_728c22273b0a":{"text":"Let this kin take actions during your chat, such as sending selfies and starting calls."},"chat.feedback_7eff8d990bcb":{"text":"The gender used for this kin\'s profile and generated content."},"chat.feedback_7f7021662775":{"text":"Off keeps Learned Context saved but does not use or update it. On uses it and lets your Kindroid update it from conversations; you can still edit it anytime."},"chat.feedback_8367a2ef8ba5":{"text":"How long to wait after you stop speaking before the kin responds. Applies to every kin\'s calls."},"chat.feedback_84ecff71735b":{"text":"What your Kindroid should focus on or do while you\'re away."},"chat.feedback_8c31e6e72230":{"text":"Local"},"chat.feedback_8e3e05b4c5c2":{"text":"The name shown for this kin throughout the app."},"chat.feedback_9c18a7ec126b":{"text":"{{name}} periodically writes these notes based on your conversations. Favorited messages can nudge what gets remembered.{{updated}} The switch saves immediately; edits below use Save Personality."},"chat.feedback_a258b30f88c3":{"text":"Global"},"chat.feedback_a514f206d23a":{"text":"Choose this Kin\'s bubble and text colors everywhere their messages appear."},"chat.feedback_ae835288ef1e":{"text":"Prevent proactive voice calls during the hours you set."},"chat.feedback_b27527c7f330":{"text":"Automatically switch to this persona whenever you open this chat."},"chat.feedback_b6ef3ce74d9c":{"text":"Give this kin a sense of the current date and time, plus how long it\'s been since you last spoke."},"chat.feedback_b73a5e2ca645":{"text":"Calls"},"chat.feedback_b833b6600085":{"text":"Your kindroid will lean on it less."},"chat.feedback_b9e78ba15906":{"text":"Notes provided by the shared Kindroid creator. This is for your reference only and is not used by the AI."},"chat.feedback_c4e7fbfaed9a":{"text":"Choose which of your synced calendars this Kindroid may reference."},"chat.feedback_c62f17b37d45":{"text":"Let your Kindroid bring up calls you missed when they next reach out."},"chat.feedback_c6e6fe3050c0":{"text":"No recalled journal entries."},"chat.feedback_c805dd99cd38":{"text":"Who the Kin talks to during the call."},"chat.feedback_da974a11b5f0":{"text":"No proactive voice calls between these times."},"chat.feedback_db362139cd9c":{"text":"Higher values reduce repetition more strongly, especially at higher dynamism, but may alter personality or coherence. Default is 0 (off); start low and tune up only if repetition is a persistent problem. LLM V7 only."},"chat.feedback_dba1434cd705":{"text":"Pick an image to show behind your chat with this kin."},"chat.feedback_df3e6fd301d1":{"text":"your kindroid"},"chat.feedback_e5231ccb83b5":{"text":"The model used to generate this kin\'s video selfies. Each model has its own motion style and quality. Latest always maps to the newest video model."},"chat.feedback_e7b5bd3a1b4c":{"text":"Thoughts"},"chat.feedback_e7cf37c2d293":{"text":"~2k credits / min"},"chat.feedback_fa023ac350e0":{"text":"Journal entries {{name}} recalled for this chat."},"chat.feedback_fa3c3ba5a5ef":{"text":"Driving image used for live video. Your main avatar is used when none is set. Works best with a waist-up, front-facing photo with hands visible. The avatar moves its arms and body, so close-up headshots look less natural."},"chat.journal_added_by_kin":{"text":"Added by {{name}}"},"chat.journal_delete_explanation":{"text":"This entry will no longer be available to kins for recall."},"chat.journal_global_caption":{"text":"Global journal entries \xb7 Visible across every Kindroid"},"chat.journal_kin_caption":{"text":"Only {{name}} recalls these"},"chat.journal_suggested_by_kin":{"text":"Suggested by {{name}}"},"chat.journal_suggestions_heading":{"text":"Suggestions from {{name}}"},"chat.journal_suggestions_caption":{"text":"These aren\'t recalled until you approve them"},"chat.journal_suggestion_approve":{"text":"Approve"},"chat.journal_suggestion_edit":{"text":"Edit"},"chat.journal_suggestion_dismiss":{"text":"Dismiss"},"chat.journal_review_suggestion":{"text":"Review suggestion"},"chat.journal_suggestion_approved":{"text":"Added to journal"},"chat.journal_suggestion_dismissed":{"text":"Suggestion dismissed"},"chat.couldn_t_approve_journal_suggestion":{"text":"Couldn\'t approve suggestion"},"chat.couldn_t_dismiss_journal_suggestion":{"text":"Couldn\'t dismiss suggestion"},"chat.journal_suggestions_waiting_label":{"text":"{{label}}, suggestions waiting"},"chat.suggest_journal_entries":{"text":"Suggest journal entries"},"chat.suggest_journal_entries_info":{"text":"Suggestions wait in the journal until you approve them"},"chat.couldn_t_update_journal_suggestions":{"text":"Couldn\'t update journal suggestions"},"chat.reasoning_description_high":{"text":"Deliberate, slower reasoning for maximum depth and fewer mistakes."},"chat.reasoning_description_low":{"text":"Deeper pass of reasoning for more reliable answers while staying highly responsive."},"chat.reasoning_description_med":{"text":"More reasoning that keeps context, at the expense of latency."},"chat.reasoning_description_none":{"text":"Speedy replies with minimal hidden planning. Best for spontaneous and natural responses."},"chat.reasoning_description_xhigh":{"text":"Extended reasoning for the most complex scenarios. Significantly slower but with maximum depth."},"chat.reasoning_label_extra_slow":{"text":"Extra slow"},"chat.reasoning_label_slow":{"text":"Slow"},"chat.reasoning_label_speedy":{"text":"Speedy"},"chat.reasoning_label_very_slow":{"text":"Very slow"},"common.describe_appearance":{"text":"Describe appearance"},"common.feedback_03ce80de0055":{"text":"Photoreal"},"common.feedback_39bd0e2f334a":{"text":"An optional starting summary used when this Kindroid joins a Room. Everyone in the Room can see it, so avoid private information."},"common.feedback_3eac161518fc":{"text":"Anime"},"common.feedback_4f9a966fb271":{"text":"Focused"},"common.feedback_ad79c3784863":{"text":"An optional starting summary used when this persona joins a Room. Everyone in the Room can see it, so avoid private information."},"common.feedback_ba930b50885d":{"text":"Immersive"},"profile.feedback_039eccb3bf2f":{"text":"Upload new image"},"profile.feedback_04356f220020":{"text":"Requires Standard Subscription."},"profile.feedback_06642139cec9":{"text":"Gifted"},"profile.feedback_0a36da8a92c2":{"text":"Gift expires {{date}}."},"profile.feedback_1b11924bde4e":{"text":"Defining moments the kin always remembers and refers back to."},"profile.feedback_2cfca9121078":{"text":"Vertical position of the background image."},"profile.feedback_47973cc49672":{"text":"Purchase ({{price}}/mo)"},"profile.feedback_47de85d38459":{"text":"Base subscription required for premium access."},"profile.feedback_4c457ec070a7":{"text":"Subscribed via: {{platform}}"},"profile.platform_web":{"text":"Web"},"profile.feedback_4d717d879d8c":{"text":"A quick starting point for the chat backdrop — tune the controls below after picking one."},"profile.feedback_4fb7dbce44a1":{"text":"The voice timbre this kin uses on calls and voice messages."},"profile.feedback_52ebc6a8bac0":{"text":"How much the background image is softened behind messages."},"profile.feedback_563c90451ee4":{"text":"Who they are — their history, personality, and the world they live in."},"profile.feedback_576e73032062":{"text":"Available as a monthly add-on."},"profile.feedback_5c20e9d2fdcf":{"text":"The scene shown behind your chat. Upload an image or import one from another kindroid."},"profile.feedback_644cbb1e678a":{"text":"A standing instruction applied to every reply."},"profile.feedback_690b7663d49f":{"text":"Keywords that help people discover this kin when browsing or searching."},"profile.feedback_69adde9c8a9f":{"text":"Available again {{date}}"},"profile.feedback_6f03fe2fff99":{"text":"Lets the kin reference the real-world time and date in conversation."},"profile.feedback_748630acd46c":{"text":"Subscribed via: {{platform}} until {{date}}"},"profile.feedback_7daa837c505a":{"text":"A short relationship label (Friend, Family, Co-worker) to help you organize your personas."},"profile.feedback_7ec0261b8e8a":{"text":"Upgrade"},"profile.feedback_8a10ef67f3f7":{"text":"Requires Ultra Subscription."},"profile.feedback_8aa3cf5382be":{"text":"How much clear space is kept at the top before messages fade in."},"profile.feedback_985cd9806d39":{"text":"A note for people who download this kin. Never sent to the AI."},"profile.feedback_9a7ea3ef8266":{"text":"How much character the kin layers on its base voice. Companion stays warm; Roleplay leans descriptive; Minimal stays literal; Narrative is story-driven."},"profile.feedback_9cbbd2c3faa2":{"text":"The model that drives responses. Latest is the balanced default; legacy versions are kept for consistency with older kins."},"profile.feedback_9fbc3bba28ff":{"text":"How this kin identifies. Shown on the listing and used in generated content."},"profile.feedback_a3c610d90da7":{"text":"How long the kin thinks before replying."},"profile.feedback_a424e33d9093":{"text":"Locked"},"profile.feedback_a455e51b00cf":{"text":"The opening message every new user sees when they start a chat with this kin."},"profile.feedback_ab9d4904e702":{"text":"The name your kindroid calls you when you chat as this persona."},"profile.feedback_aca6773292af":{"text":"Who can find this kin. Public is listed for everyone; Unlisted needs the code or link; Private is only you."},"profile.feedback_b2cf40e68c58":{"text":"Use Google Messages with RCS enabled on Android, or iMessage or RCS on iPhone. SMS/MMS is unsupported and may fail. For the most reliable experience, use the Kindroid app."},"profile.feedback_b6f078cdc06b":{"text":"How light or dark the background appears behind messages."},"profile.feedback_ba2738259797":{"text":"How much energy the kin brings. Lower keeps replies steady and on-topic; higher adds variety and surprise."},"profile.feedback_c53554e438b1":{"text":"A written description of their appearance, used to generate the avatar."},"profile.feedback_ca39ea11e9b1":{"text":"Gifted access can be upgraded to a paid subscription at any time."},"profile.feedback_ca8038e1b130":{"text":"Context about you as this persona — your history and how you relate to the kin."},"profile.feedback_cda9b9a6cf68":{"text":"Horizontal position of the background image."},"profile.feedback_cf0072381578":{"text":"Lets other users duplicate this kin and tweak it into their own."},"profile.feedback_d2f97ecbddca":{"text":"The name new users see and call this kin."},"profile.feedback_d5c996ded2e8":{"text":"Up to three images or short videos shown on the listing. The first is the primary cover."},"profile.feedback_df22d95e278b":{"text":"The picture shown for this kin in chat. Upload a new image to change it."},"profile.feedback_e0a9c0834b66":{"text":"The model used to generate selfies. Latest is recommended; legacy versions are kept for consistency."},"profile.feedback_e338bad9ebc6":{"text":"A one-line hook shown on your shared listing — the first thing browsers read."},"profile.feedback_e843bef3505c":{"text":"How you identify as this persona — shapes how the kindroid refers to you."},"profile.feedback_ed59a0ca88c6":{"text":"Keep chatting and engaging with your Kindroids to qualify."},"profile.feedback_f3e680b96181":{"text":"Requires Standard"},"profile.feedback_f411a1fb6275":{"text":"Free"},"profile.feedback_f4ba0c8a94a3":{"text":"Requires Ultra"},"profile.feedback_fc7f1aa2054c":{"text":"Listing"},"profile.feedback_fd346612e615":{"text":"A sample line that captures how this kin talks."},"profile.feedback_30799efd431c":{"text":"Gift from Kindroid"},"profile.feedback_9ccded750228":{"text":"Gift from a friend"},"chat.hide_voice":{"text":"Hide Voice"},"chat.show_voice":{"text":"Show Voice"},"account.export_unavailable_support":{"text":"Data export is unavailable, please contact support."},"account.export_check_failed":{"text":"Couldn\'t check export availability. Try again."},"account.export_preparing_short":{"text":"Preparing export"},"account.export_preparing_next":{"text":"Preparing export \xb7 available again {{date}}"},"rooms.kin_reply_failed":{"text":"Couldn’t get a reply from {{value1}}. Other Kins can continue."},"chat.group_selfie_arrange_and_direct":{"text":"Individual prompts"},"chat.group_selfie_hide_details":{"text":"Hide prompts"},"chat.group_selfie_move_earlier":{"text":"Move {{name}} left"},"chat.group_selfie_move_later":{"text":"Move {{name}} right"},"rooms.choosing_who_speaks_next":{"text":"Choosing who speaks next…"},"rooms.kin_is_responding":{"text":"{{name}} is responding…"},"rooms.waiting_for_people":{"text":"Waiting for people…"},"reactions.aiLabel":{"text":"AI reactions"},"reactions.settingDescription":{"text":"Let Kins occasionally react with emojis in this conversation. Turning this off keeps existing reactions. You can still react."},"reactions.you":{"text":"You"},"reactions.participant":{"text":"Participant"},"reactions.attribution":{"text":"{{names}} reacted with {{emoji}}"},"reactions.saveFailed":{"text":"Could not save your reaction. Please try again."},"reactions.slots":{"text":"Reaction slots"},"reactions.replaceSlot":{"text":"Replace {{emoji}} in slot {{number}}"},"reactions.addSlot":{"text":"Add emoji to slot {{number}}"},"reactions.removeSlot":{"text":"Remove {{emoji}} from slot {{number}}"},"reactions.search":{"text":"Search emojis"},"reactions.emojis":{"text":"Emojis"},"reactions.full":{"text":"All 12 slots are filled. Use Edit to replace an emoji."},"reactions.added":{"text":"{{emoji}}, already added"},"reactions.add":{"text":"Add {{emoji}}"},"reactions.none":{"text":"No emojis found."},"reactions.customize":{"text":"Customize reactions"},"reactions.react":{"text":"React to message"},"reactions.backSlots":{"text":"Back to reaction slots"},"reactions.backPicker":{"text":"Back to emoji picker"},"reactions.backReactions":{"text":"Back to reactions"},"reactions.backActions":{"text":"Back to message actions"},"reactions.chooseSlot":{"text":"Choose emoji for slot {{number}}"},"reactions.slotCount":{"text":"{{count}} of {{max}} slots"},"reactions.change":{"text":"Change your {{emoji}} reaction"},"reactions.custom":{"text":"Add a custom emoji"},"reactions.remove":{"text":"Remove {{emoji}} reaction"},"reactions.with":{"text":"React with {{emoji}}"},"reactions.edit":{"text":"Edit"},"reactions.done":{"text":"Done"},"social.block_creator":{"text":"Block creator"},"social.block_creator_title":{"text":"Block this creator?"},"social.block_creator_description":{"text":"You won\'t see each other\'s social content or shared Kindroids. Existing Kindroids you\'ve added won\'t be removed."},"social.creator_blocked":{"text":"You\'ve blocked this creator."},"social.content_unavailable":{"text":"Content unavailable"},"social.manage_blocked_accounts":{"text":"Manage blocked accounts"},"social.block_scope_description":{"text":"Account-to-account blocks apply to social content and sh